@page
@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions<CiamLabApp.BrandingOptions> BrandOpt
@*
    Demo About page. Replace the copy below with your own.
    Brand label and full name come from appsettings.json (Branding section).
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Acerca";
    var brand = BrandOpt.Value;
}

<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 pt-16 pb-12">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/70 backdrop-blur border border-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-700 shadow-soft">
        Sobre nosotros
    </span>
    <h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
        Una nueva forma de
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 via-pink-500 to-duck-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">cuidar tu dinero</span>.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        @brand.FullName es una plataforma demostrativa que reúne las mejores prácticas modernas: identidad CIAM con Microsoft Entra External ID, hosting en Azure App Service, y una experiencia construida en React + Tailwind con foco en accesibilidad y velocidad.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 pb-12">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/80 backdrop-blur border border-slate-200 p-7 shadow-soft">
        <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400 to-teal-500 text-white shadow-soft">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display font-bold text-xl">Seguridad por diseño</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">OIDC, MFA opcional y federación con identidades sociales. Sin contraseñas en nuestra base de datos.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/80 backdrop-blur border border-slate-200 p-7 shadow-soft">
        <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-pink-500 text-white shadow-soft">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display font-bold text-xl">Rápido como un patito</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">React 18, edge caching y un backend mínimo. Carga inicial en menos de 1 segundo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/80 backdrop-blur border border-slate-200 p-7 shadow-soft">
        <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-duck-500 to-orange-500 text-white shadow-soft">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display font-bold text-xl">Hecho con cariño</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Cuidamos los detalles: animaciones suaves, contraste accesible y un diseño que da gusto usar.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 pb-12">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white p-8 lg:p-12 shadow-glow">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold">Stack técnico de la demo</h2>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-duck-500 shrink-0"></span><div><span class="font-semibold">Identidad:</span> Microsoft Entra External ID (CIAM) con federación a Google y Email/OTP.</div></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-duck-500 shrink-0"></span><div><span class="font-semibold">Hosting:</span> Azure App Service Linux B1 (West Europe) con Easy Auth como capa OIDC.</div></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-duck-500 shrink-0"></span><div><span class="font-semibold">Backend:</span> .NET 8 Razor Pages — bridge de claims desde X-MS-CLIENT-PRINCIPAL.</div></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-duck-500 shrink-0"></span><div><span class="font-semibold">Frontend:</span> React 18 + htm + Tailwind CSS con import maps (sin build pipeline).</div></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
